# PEDAL (0.16.21, issue #3: "harmonic drone followers"): on the Progression page white key 9 switches the bass, white key 10 the pad,
# between following the chords and holding the key (a pedal: the bass on the key's root, the pad on the key's chord) while the harmony
# moves on above. Kept with the player's settings (the global record), through a reboot. And the six new fills on black keys 6-11.
seed 0
wait 3000
press EDIT
wait 600
release EDIT
wait 100
expect view 5
expect pool 0x5AD
# one bar a chord, the whole circle (A minor: Am Dm G C F Bdim Em Am)
turn K3 -2
tapkey b4
wait 200
expect prgslot1 4
tap PLAY
wait 2500
expect progpos 0
expect chordroot 9
expect bassheld 9
tap EDIT
wait 2200
expect progpos 1
expect chordroot 2
expect bassheld 2
# the bass on pedal: A under Dm
tapkey w8
wait 300
expect bassheld 9
expect chordroot 2
shot pedal_page.png
tap EDIT
wait 2200
expect progpos 2
expect chordroot 7
expect bassheld 9
# the pad on pedal too: its voices hold Am7 (A C E G) under G7
tapkey w9
wait 300
expect chordroot 7
expect padheld0 7
expect padheld1 9
expect padheld2 0
expect padheld3 4
shot pedal_pad.png
# back to following: the bass on G
tapkey w8
wait 300
expect bassheld 7
# kept through power-off: the pad still on pedal, the bass following
reboot
wait 3000
press EDIT
wait 600
release EDIT
wait 100
shot pedal_after_reboot.png
# the new fills (black keys 6-11): I IV V V, I iii IV vi, IV V IV I
tapkey b5
wait 200
expect prgslot0 1
expect prgslot1 4
expect prgslot2 5
expect prgslot3 5
expect prgslot4 0
tapkey b8
wait 200
expect prgslot1 3
expect prgslot3 6
tapkey b10
wait 200
expect prgslot0 4
expect prgslot1 5
expect prgslot2 4
expect prgslot3 1
